# The effect slot: v159.3 takes a bare content name (exact map lookup);
# v160.x also registers the `@status-<name>` constant and LParser normalises
# a bare known name to it, so both spellings apply. Everything else --
# `@<name>`, `status-<name>`, or an unknown name -- resolves to null and is a
# silent no-op. Statement indices below are 0-based, matching `jump`.
ubind @flare
status false unmoving @unit 60
status false @status-unmoving @unit 60
status false wet @unit 60
status false @unmoving @unit 60
status false status-unmoving @unit 60
status false zzz_typo @unit 60
end
